# Redirects for Learn AI Anywhere website
# Netlify applies the first matching rule, so the SPA catch-all must stay last.
# Netlify matches a path with or without its trailing slash, so a rule like
# "/about/ /about" sends the page to itself in a loop: don't add those.

# Introduction to AI became AI Literacy for Everyone
/curriculum /courses/ai-literacy-for-everyone 301
/curriculum/intro-to-ai /courses/ai-literacy-for-everyone 301

# Handle SPA routing - serve index.html for all paths
/* /index.html 200
